U.S. Government Public Data Notice

This dataset packages factual public records sourced from the U.S. Centers for
Medicare & Medicaid Services and the National Plan and Provider Enumeration
System. No exclusive rights are asserted in the underlying U.S. government
records.

The source repository's transformation code is separately available under the
MIT License. Users are responsible for evaluating the source terms, privacy and
marketing rules, and other obligations that apply to their downstream use.

THE DATASET IS PROVIDED AS IS, WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. Pending enrollment
does not mean approved, enrolled, credentialed, licensed, available, interested,
or ready to buy. Verify every record before relying on it.
